-- Component masks (ex3). Twin of 03-component-masks.bqn.
-- Bare names are presence masks combined by & | !; `Bandit is the enum symbol, Bandit the mask.
-- Row 3 (bandit, faction `Bandit, but dead) keeps its faction — the .bqn's `symBandit ≡ 3⊑faction` witness is row 3 of the faction expect. Row 5 is a bandit but faction `Friendly.
--! registry 03-component-masks
--! expect gold = 110 20 130 40 150 60
--! expect health = 90 0 70 60 0 40
--! expect faction = None None Hostile Bandit Friendly Friendly

Nord , Gold += 100
Dragon , Health = 0
Bandit & !Dead & Faction == `Bandit , Faction = `Hostile
